WEBVTT

NOTE
This audio description covers Ultimecia's revelation and transformation.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 23 seconds
Scene: The Sorceress Ultimecia reveals her true forms and ascends to godhood.
For blind players: Character appearance, transformation stages, and cosmic horror elements described in vivid detail.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ultimecia emerges from the shadows at the heart of her castle. She is a tall, elegant woman of unsettling beauty. Her skin is pale and luminous, almost translucent. Her face bears dramatic geometric markings — sharp lines of black that extend from her eyes like mask patterns, reaching her cheekbones. Her eyes glow with ethereal power, and her gaze is ancient and terrible.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
She wears an elaborate dark gown of midnight blue and black, corseted and form-fitting, with a high collar and dramatic trailing skirts that seem to flow like liquid shadow. Her shoulders are adorned with large feathered wings that shimmer with iridescent darkness — they appear almost skeletal in structure, with obsidian plumage that catches light in unsettling ways. Her hair is impossibly long, cascading past her waist, colored silvery white with threads of ice-blue.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Ultimecia raises her hands, and the very fabric of the castle responds. Magical energy surges through the chamber — not a single color but a spectrum of warped light. Purple, sickly green, deep blue, and streaks of white lightning crackle through the air. Reality around her begins to tear and distort. The team takes defensive positions, weapons ready, as they realize the magnitude of what they face.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The Sorceress's transformation begins. Her elegant form convulses and shifts. Her wings expand dramatically, growing larger, their feathers becoming more pronounced and blade-like. Dark energy wraps around her like a cocoon. Her silhouette grows more monstrous. The castle itself trembles with her power — chandeliers swing wildly, stone cracks, pillars shudder.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
She ascends into a more primal, terrifying form. Her wings are now massive — each feather visible as a distinct blade of shadow. Her body becomes more angular and inhuman. Her face takes on sharp, predatory features. She is still recognizably the Sorceress, but twisted into something older, more alien. Her voice, when she speaks or cries out, echoes unnaturally across multiple tones simultaneously.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
But the transformation is not complete. The Sorceress draws deeper into power itself. Reality warps more violently. The very concept of space and time becomes visual around her — the background fractures into a kaleidoscope of different moments and locations simultaneously. She begins to transcend her physical form entirely, ascending toward her ultimate incarnation.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:62.000
Ultimecia's final form begins to manifest. She is no longer merely a being of flesh and magic — she becomes something cosmic and incomprehensible. Her silhouette expands to fill the entire chamber. She is junctioned with the universe itself, her body intertwined with the fabric of time and space. She is simultaneously a woman, a dragon, a constellation, and pure abstract power. The color palette shifts to whites, silvers, and iridescent cosmic blues.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Her god-like presence is overwhelming. The team stands dwarfed before her. The ground beneath them ripples like water. The air becomes difficult to parse — is it solid, liquid, or pure energy? Ultimecia's wings stretch impossibly wide, spanning the entire width of the chamber and beyond. They shimmer with the light of dying stars. Her form radiates a terrible beauty — the aesthetic of inevitable doom.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.000
The Sorceress's expression is serene and ancient, as if she has transcended emotion entirely. She looks upon the team with the detached gaze of a force of nature. All around her, the compressed timeline of her castle responds to her ascension. Objects float, gravity becomes meaningless, and the oppressive atmosphere reaches a crescendo. The team must now face the woman who would compress all of time into a single moment of her rule.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:23.000
She stands ready for the final battle, cosmic and terrible, beautiful and absolutely lethal. This is the culmination of her ambitions, the moment she has been building toward since she first learned of Time Compression. The team exchanges glances of steely determination — they came to this castle to save the world, and now they will either triumph or cease to exist as the timeline collapses around them.
